                <div style="border-left: 3px solid #e74c3c; padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                  <h5 style="color: #e74c3c; margin-bottom: 5px;">9:00-9:45 AM</h5>
                  <strong>Why modular monoliths won, and what AI changes</strong>
                  <p style="margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 0;">The microservices hangover; the monolith-first path; what "extractable" actually requires. What an agentic coding tool actually is and why architecture discipline is precisely what makes it effective.</p>
